{
  "slug": "gobble-rug-2024-10",
  "kind": "token-rug",
  "title": "Gobble (GOBBLE) liquidity pull, 10 October 2024",
  "network": "mainnet",
  "summary": "Chain-only case: no public source names it. 0x5fb4b721 got 2,003 SUI from 0x8b302e06 at 03:29 UTC and published GOBBLE (1B supply, TreasuryCap sent to 0x0) at 03:38. By 03:40 it had opened a full-range Cetus position with 1,000 SUI and 500M GOBBLE and a BlueMove v1 pool with the same amounts, keeping the Cetus Position object and the LSP<SUI, GOBBLE> LP coin in its own wallet with no lock. At 03:46:57 it closed the Cetus position (1,321.85 SUI) and at 03:47:54 burned the LP coin through BlueMove remove_liquidity (1,302.14 SUI), leaving both pools with dust. It had put in 2,000.04 SUI and took out 2,623.98, so buyers lost about 624 SUI over nine minutes. At 11:56 it sent 2,626 SUI to 0x721ebd9e, which funded the next deployer, 0x4ec4701f, with the same 2,003 SUI; that wallet ran the same play with MONKSUI (published 12:46, pulled 12:55).",
